b('B033','Spatial spot mixtures versus individual cells','Single-cell methods','Overlay capture spots on a tissue frame and show several cell instances intersecting a spot, followed by an explicitly mixed readout.','spatial transcriptomics slide;tissue capture spot array;epithelial sheet','Verify platform resolution and capture model; do not label a multicell spot as a single cell.','roadmap:57')
